    "title_en": "On Douglas' conjecture for $m$-Kronecker quivers",
    "abstract_en": "We prove Douglas' conjecture for $m$-Kronecker quivers for each $m \\geq 3$ on the normalized logarithms of Euler characteristics of moduli spaces. Also, we state a log-concavity conjecture on Euler characteristics near slope one for the 3-Kronecker quiver.",
